      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "QUIRKY PRINCESS (10) is improving with racing and can get her Maiden win out of the way today fourth up. Covered ground and plugged to the line when fourth over 2200m at Scone. This looks easier in the small field. HEAPY'S LEGACY (4) is holding his form and doesn't have to improve much to win. Returned good figures when he savaged the line to secure third over 2200m at Dubbo. Will drift back again and can finish over the top of these. IMMORTAL ROSE (6) trained locally and could be looking for this trip now. Sat on the good speed and peaked on the run over the final 200m when sixth over 1600m at this track. Key jockey change and assess on the earlier wins. LONE STAR DREAM (8) drifted further back than anticipated and happy to overlook the below-par sixth over 2200m at Dubbo. Senior rider hops aboard and will race much closer. Respect.",
